menu "USB (OTG FS Device)"

# The USB device port the ESC configurator talks to. PA11/PA12 is the only
# OTG FS pair on the F407V package, so these choices exist to keep the pins
# in the generated pin map (and under its collision checks) rather than to
# offer a real alternative.
#
# The other two OTG FS signals are unavailable by design: ID is PA10 and VBUS
# is PA9, both already spoken for by USART1 to the ESP32. The driver therefore
# forces device mode and runs with VBUS sensing disabled.

