      same time. Higher values win.

config STM32_RC_RECEIVER_CRSF_GPS_SEND_ON_CHANGE
    bool "Prefer send on change"
    default y
    help
      Suppress repeated CRSF GPS frames when the encoded payload has not
      changed since the last send. A keepalive resend still occurs when the
      max-silence window expires.

config STM32_RC_RECEIVER_CRSF_GPS_MAX_SILENCE_MS
    int "Max silence (ms)"
    range 0 60000
    default 2000
    help
      Longest time the scheduler may suppress unchanged CRSF GPS telemetry
      before forcing a resend. Set to 0 to only send GPS when the payload
      changes.

config STM32_RC_RECEIVER_CRSF_GPS_FRESH_TIMEOUT_MS
    int "Freshness timeout (ms)"
    range 1 60000
    default 2000
    help
      Maximum age of a GPS sample before the CRSF scheduler stops forwarding
      GPS telemetry and waits for fresher navigation data.

